# Desk display touch calibration (XPT2046 / "ADS7846 Touchscreen" on the 3.5" panel).
# The touch layer is turned 90° to the picture: screen x follows raw y, screen y follows raw x backwards.
# Matrix: screen_x = a*raw_x + b*raw_y + c ; screen_y = d*raw_x + e*raw_y + f   (all 0..1)
# Re-measure: see DEPLOY.md, step 9.
ACTION=="add|change", KERNEL=="event*", ATTRS{name}=="ADS7846 Touchscreen", ENV{LIBINPUT_CALIBRATION_MATRIX}="0 1.037 -0.026 -1.031 0 0.999"
